      "name": "BigBlueButton",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "面向在线教学的完整开源虚拟教室，支持实时音视频、共享幻灯片与白板、投票、分组讨论、学习分析与录制回放。",
      "homepage": "https://bigbluebutton.org/",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/bigbluebutton/bigbluebutton",
      "github_repository_id": 684382,
      "license": "LGPL-3.0",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bigbluebutton/bigbluebutton/license",
      "features": [
        "实时共享音频、视频、幻灯片（含白板标注）、聊天与屏幕",
        "教师/主持人可用投票、表情、多用户白板、共享笔记与分组讨论组织课堂参与",
